pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  这一页只说明当前工程边界和主仓库，不把历史仓库、资料压缩包和当前主线混在一起。车辆侧当前以 spore-vehicle-nav 为准，Web 侧以 spore-monitor-web 为准。
elements:
  - elementId: p2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 32, 840, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 当前工程已经分成四条主线，车辆主仓库已统一
  - elementId: p2-meta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 70, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$muted"
      text: 架构边界：Web 负责编排与展示；车辆端负责实时控制、定位、避障和底层安全
  - elementId: p2-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 98, 840, 2]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p2-flow-1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [280, 170, 90, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p2-flow-2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [540, 170, 90, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p2-flow-3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [755, 225, 1, 50]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0.5,0 0.5,1"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p2-flow-4
    elementType: line
    bounds: [630, 350, 1, 50]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0.5,0 0.5,1"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p2-web-node
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [65, 135, 215, 70]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primarySoft"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p2-route-node
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [370, 135, 170, 70]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primaryTint"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p2-vehicle-node
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [630, 125, 250, 100]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p2-data-node
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [505, 400, 250, 65]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primarySoft"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p2-web-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 151, 185, 38]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [center, middle]
      bold: true
      text: Web 控制台
  - elementId: p2-web-sub
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 185, 185, 18]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      align: [center, top]
      color: "$muted"
      text: 规划 / 监控 / 分析
  - elementId: p2-route-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [382, 151, 146, 38]
