  - elementId: p2-branches
    elementType: text
    bounds: [65, 270, 400, 160]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        当前目录中的主线仓库

        车辆主线：spore-vehicle-nav
        Web 主线：spore-monitor-web
        历史基础：spore-patrol-robot
        雷达快照：spore-patrol-robot-feature-lidar
  - elementId: p2-repo-status
    elementType: text
    bounds: [65, 455, 400, 42]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      color: "$muted"
      text: 车辆仓库干净；Web 最新整合改动尚未提交；雷达快照无 Git。
  - elementId: p2-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [850, 492, 50, 18]
    content:
      style: "$muted"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 02 / 11

